Description: Event Timeline widget for Zabbix dashboard
 Visualizes problem events by time, host, host group or event. Supports fixed
 or widget-linked targets, canonical trigger and LLD prototype expansion,
 runtime controls, item-characteristic filters, paging and drilldown.
